\title{What path observables determine}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{Two endpoint scalars can test a transported vector without
recording the whole transport. When do such measurements distinguish
all joint gauge orbits of a connection and a scalar field, as
classified in \ref{fdip-0112}?}

